"Das Qiskit-Paket hat noch keine Basisklasse für das Executor-Primitive.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Before you begin {#before-you-begin}"
msgstr "Bevor du beginnst {#before-you-begin}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Some of the code examples on this page use `samplex`, which is part of the "
"Samplomatic package.  Therefore, before running those code block, you must "
"install Samplomatic, as shown in the following code block.  For more "
"information, see the [Samplomatic "
"documentation](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic).\n"
msgstr ""
"Einige der Codebeispiele auf dieser Seite verwenden `samplex`, das Teil des "
"Samplomatic-Pakets ist. Deshalb musst du Samplomatic installieren, bevor du "
"diese Codeblöcke ausführst, wie im folgenden Codeblock gezeigt. Weitere "
"Informationen findest du in der [Samplomatic-"
"Dokumentation](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Steps to use the Executor primitive {#steps-to-use-the-executor-primitive}"
msgstr ""
"Schritte zur Verwendung des Executor-Primitive {#steps-to-use-the-executor-"
"primitive}"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. Initialize the account {#1-initialize-the-account}"
msgstr "1. Das Konto initialisieren {#1-initialize-the-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because Qiskit Runtime is a managed service, you first need to initialize "
"your account. You can then select the QPU you want to use to calculate the "
"expectation value.\n"
msgstr ""
"Da Qiskit Runtime ein verwalteter Dienst ist, musst du zunächst dein Konto "
"initialisieren. Du kannst dann den QPU auswählen, den du zur Berechnung des "
"Erwartungswerts verwenden möchtest.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow the steps in the [Set up your IBM Cloud&reg; account](/guides/cloud-"
"setup) if you don't already have an account.\n"
msgstr ""
"Folge den Schritten unter [Richte dein IBM Cloud&reg;-Konto "
"ein](/guides/cloud-setup), falls du noch kein Konto hast.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "2. Create and transpile a circuit {#2-create-and-transpile-a-circuit}"
msgstr ""
"2. Einen Circuit erstellen und transpilieren {#2-create-and-transpile-a-"
"circuit}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You need at least one circuit to use the Executor primitive.  It can "
"optionally have parameters.\n"
msgstr ""
"Du benötigst mindestens einen Circuit, um das Executor-Primitive zu "
"verwenden. Er kann optional Parameter haben.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The circuit needs to be transformed to only use instructions supported by "
"the QPU (referred to as *instruction set architecture (ISA)* circuits). Use "
"the transpiler to do this.\n"
msgstr ""
"Der Circuit muss so transformiert werden, dass er nur Anweisungen verwendet,"
" die vom QPU unterstützt werden (sogenannte *Instruction Set Architecture "
"(ISA)*-Circuits). Verwende dafür den Transpiler.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "3. Initialize a `QuantumProgram` {#3-initialize-a-quantumprogram}"
msgstr ""
"3. Ein `QuantumProgram` initialisieren {#3-initialize-a-quantumprogram}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Initialize a `QuantumProgram` with your workload. A `QuantumProgram` is made"
" up of `QuantumProgramItems`. Typically, each item consists of a circuit, a "
"set of parameter values, and possibly a `samplex` to randomize the circuit "
"content. For full details, see [Executor inputs and "
"outputs](/guides/executor-input-output).\n"
msgstr ""
"Initialisiere ein `QuantumProgram` mit deiner Arbeitslast. Ein "
"`QuantumProgram` besteht aus `QuantumProgramItems`. In der Regel enthält "
"jedes Element einen Circuit, einen Satz von Parameterwerten und "
"möglicherweise ein `samplex`, um den Circuit-Inhalt zu randomisieren. Alle "
"Details findest du unter [Executor-Eingaben und -Ausgaben](/guides/executor-"
"input-output).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following cell initializes a `QuantumProgram` and specifies to perform "
"25 shots. Next, it appends the transpiled target circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Die folgende Zelle initialisiert ein `QuantumProgram` und gibt an, 25 Shots "
"durchzuführen. Anschließend wird der transpilierte Ziel-Circuit angehängt.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4. Optional: Group gates and measurements into annotated boxes {#4-optional-"
"group-gates-and-measurements-into-annotated-boxes}"
msgstr ""
"4. Optional: Gates und Messungen in annotierte Boxen gruppieren "
"{#4-optional-group-gates-and-measurements-into-annotated-boxes}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Grouping instructions into boxes and annotating them is the primary way to "
"specify your intent. In the following example, we use "
"`generate_boxing_pass_manager` and its twirling parameters to group two-"
"qubit gates and measurements into boxes and apply twirling annotation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Das Gruppieren von Anweisungen in Boxen und deren Annotierung ist der "
"primäre Weg, um deine Absicht anzugeben. Im folgenden Beispiel verwenden wir"
" `generate_boxing_pass_manager` und seine Twirling-Parameter, um Zwei-Qubit-"
"Gates und Messungen in Boxen zu gruppieren und Twirling-Annotierung "
"anzuwenden.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/get-started-with-"
"executor/extracted-outputs/245a4574-3ce9-4f77-98c8-af32cde8ac01-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/get-started-with-"
"executor/extracted-outputs/245a4574-3ce9-4f77-98c8-af32cde8ac01-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"5. Optional: Build a template circuit and samplex, and add them to the "
"program {#5-optional-build-a-template-circuit-and-samplex-and-add-them-to-"
"the-program}"
msgstr ""
"5. Optional: Einen Template-Circuit und Samplex erstellen und zum Programm "
"hinzufügen {#5-optional-build-a-template-circuit-and-samplex-and-add-them-"
"to-the-program}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, use the Samplomatic "
"[build](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/api/auto/samplomatic.build.html#samplomatic.build)"
" method to generate the _template circuit_ and _samplex_ pair. The template "
"circuit is structurally equivalent to the original circuit. However, its "
"single-qubit gates are replaced by parameterized gates in order to implement"
" the prescribed annotations (gate and measurement twirling, in this "
"example). The samplex encodes all the information required to generate "
"randomized parameters for the template circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Verwende als Nächstes die Samplomatic-Methode "
"[build](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/api/auto/samplomatic.build.html#samplomatic.build),"
" um das _Template-Circuit_- und _Samplex_-Paar zu generieren. Der Template-"
"Circuit ist strukturell äquivalent zum ursprünglichen Circuit. Allerdings "
"werden seine Einzel-Qubit-Gates durch parametrisierte Gates ersetzt, um die "
"vorgeschriebenen Annotierungen zu implementieren (Gate- und Messungs-"
"Twirling in diesem Beispiel). Das Samplex kodiert alle Informationen, die "
"benötigt werden, um randomisierte Parameter für den Template-Circuit zu "
"generieren.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After generating the template circuit and samplex pair, use the "
"`append_samplex_item` method to add the pair to the program.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nachdem du das Template-Circuit- und Samplex-Paar generiert hast, verwende "
"die Methode `append_samplex_item`, um das Paar zum Programm hinzuzufügen.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the Samplomatic "
"[API](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/api/index.html) documentation for"
" full details about `samplomatic.samplex.Samplex` and its arguments.\n"
msgstr ""
"Die vollständigen Details zu `samplomatic.samplex.Samplex` und seinen "
"Argumenten findest du in der "
"Samplomatic-[API](https://qiskit.github.io/samplomatic/api/index.html)-Dokumentation.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"6. Invoke Executor and get results {#6-invoke-executor-and-get-results}"
msgstr ""
"6. Executor aufrufen und Ergebnisse abrufen {#6-invoke-executor-and-get-"
"results}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run the `QuantumProgram` on an IBM&reg; backend by using the `Executor` "
"primitive with default options. See [Executor options](/guides/executor-"
"options) to learn about the available options.\n"
msgstr ""
"Führe das `QuantumProgram` auf einem IBM&reg;-Backend aus, indem du das "
"`Executor`-Primitive mit Standardoptionen verwendest. Unter [Executor-"
"Optionen](/guides/executor-options) erfährst du mehr über die verfügbaren "
"Optionen.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The result is of type "
"[`QuantumProgramResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/results-quantum-program-result). See [Executor input and "
"output](/guides/executor-input-output) to learn about the result object.\n"
msgstr ""
"Das Ergebnis ist vom Typ "
"[`QuantumProgramResult`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/results-quantum-program-result). Unter [Executor-Eingabe und "
"-Ausgabe](/guides/executor-input-output) erfährst du mehr über das "
"Ergebnisobjekt.\n"

